; Built by examples/wikidata/build.py from Wikidata (CC0, wikidata.org) on 2026-11-09: every entity-valued
; property, 1,790 of them, glossed from its English label, and the 23,116 entity-valued
; statements Wikidata holds about 1,165 entities, in 120 of those properties. Wikidata's own
; answer to the question, as examples/wikidata/questions.py defines it, has 1,164 entities.
; victoria.ids.tsv gives each name's Wikidata id. The question comes first.

; Who descends from Queen Victoria? Wikidata has no descendant property, and none of its 1,790 entity-valued
; properties is called "parent of"; the question uses its own words and its own rules.
(gloss parent_of "{x} is a parent of {y}")
(gloss descendant_of "{x} is a descendant of {y}")
(= (descendant_of $X $Y) (parent_of $Y $X))
(= (descendant_of $X $Z) (let True (parent_of $Y $X) (descendant_of $Y $Z)))
(query (descendant_of $X queen_victoria))

